 gents-representatives\nCommencement source: https://www.legislation.vic.go
 v.au/sites/default/files/2026-08/Commencement-Information-for-statutory-ru
 les-made-this-year.pdf\nNote: OC fee change per CAV OC page: https://www.c
 onsumer.vic.gov.au/licensing-and-registration/owners-corporation-managers/
 new-education-rules-owners-corporation-managers\n\nLast checked: 2026-10-1
 9\nGeneral information only\, not legal advice.
