 hips-traineeships-schools-and-other-matters-bill\nCommencement source: htt
 ps://www.gazette.vic.gov.au/gazette/Gazettes2026/GG2026S512.pdf\n\nLast ch
 ecked: 2026-10-19\nGeneral information only\, not legal advice.
