BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Rental energy efficiency standards: first phase (phased)
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270301
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270302
DTSTAMP:20261019T000000Z
UID:rental-mees-phase1@plainenglishlaw.vic-commencements
CATEGORIES:Victoria,Phased start
DESCRIPTION:New minimum energy efficiency standards for rentals start. Bro
 ken heaters and hot water systems must be replaced with efficient electric
  ones\; cooling\, 4-star showerheads and ceiling insulation apply at a new
  lease or a switch to month-to-month.\n\nDate type: Phased start\nJurisdic
 tion: Victoria\nWho it affects: Renters and rental providers\n\nOfficial s
 ource: https://www.consumer.vic.gov.au/resources-and-tools/legislation/pub
 lic-consultations-and-reviews/new-minimum-energy-efficiency-standards\nCom
 mencement source: https://www.consumer.vic.gov.au/housing/renting/new-chan
 ges-to-the-rental-laws\nNote: Phased: draughtproofing from 1 Jul 2027\; co
 oling in all rentals from 1 Jul 2030. Exemptions apply.\n\nLast checked: 2
 026-10-19\nGeneral information only\, not legal advice.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://www.consumer.vic.gov.au/resources-and-tools/legislation/public
 -consultations-and-reviews/new-minimum-energy-efficiency-standards
END:VEVENT
